Compression algorithms reduce redundant data in order to decrease the amount of storage needed for that data.

422
01:19:06,912 --> 01:19:14,572
Data compression is an appealing method for lowering communication costs by properly utilizing existing bandwidth.

423
01:19:14,572 --> 01:19:31,112
The amount of digital data communicated via the internet has increased at an parallel rate over the previous decade, presenting text, photos, video, sound, computer programs, and other types of data.

